  "bodyHash": "fc6479f4d7f04806",
  "content": "<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/783283/description_27420f6f-4979-41c7-92cc-350cdd946c16.png\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/783283/description_00282d37-7047-4d55-b3d7-fd3f0e10eed9.png\" width=\"210\" height=\"210\"></p>\n<h2><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/783283/description_e6f91da0-5b7e-4541-ab6e-9159e322afc5.png\">Simple Hot Air Balloons (SHAB)</strong></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">這是一款利用簡單的<strong><em>原版物品</em> </strong>來製作<strong><em>熱氣球！</em></strong>的模組。乘坐你自己的熱氣球飛上天空吧！本模組中的所有<strong>模型</strong>和<strong>機制</strong>都是基於<strong>真實</strong>的熱氣球設計的。<strong>所有音效</strong>也都是<strong>從真實熱氣球中錄製</strong>的……所以，不用說，我相信你會喜歡這個模組！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em><strong>請在 <a href=\"https://patreon.com/ConborgsCreations?utm_medium=unknown&utm_source=join_link&utm_campaign=creatorshare_creator&utm_content=copyLink\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patreon!</a> 支持我</strong>（成為會員以獲取 Discord 伺服器訪問權限）</em></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/783283/description_18941d98-3423-47f9-96f8-58ca7f98cf15.png\"></p>\n<h2><strong>一些基本物品包括：&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <strong style=\"font-size:16px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</strong></strong></h2>\n<p><img style=\"float:right\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/783283/description_52b094c6-eaad-4d42-8750-97e1d7e41df8.png\" width=\"240\" height=\"240\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- 熱氣球籃筐</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- 煤氣燃燒器</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- 氣囊 (<span style=\"color:#f60\"><strong>所有顏色</strong></span>)</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- 熱氣球 (<span style=\"color:#f60\"><strong>所有顏色</strong></span>)</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- 煤炭噴火器</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- 噴火器燃料</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- 氣囊滑翔翼 (<strong><span style=\"color:#f60\">所有顏色</span></strong>)</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/783283/description_df969f33-2e32-45ad-b172-82fd4752f2c1.png\"></p>\n<h2><strong>一些特殊功能包括：</strong></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- 從你的熱氣球上扔下<strong>任何方塊</strong>，以及 TNT、箭矢、打火石、 lava 桶等等……</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- 使用噴火器點燃生物！</span></p>\n<p><img style=\"float:right\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/783283/description_15f85ad2-2a10-4a85-ac7a-df096ddbe3d2.png\" width=\"245\" height=\"245\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:right\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/783283/description_c591da25-e2a4-4bd9-8707-b9d5f8887987.png\" width=\"291\" height=\"170\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\n<h2><strong><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/783283/description_2d76f236-6137-4d52-886a-981a0fc113d9.png\" width=\"1094\" height=\"81\"></strong></h2>\n<h2><strong>製作熱氣球：</strong></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>1. 煤氣燃燒器 (<span style=\"color:#f60;font-size:14px\">任意石階</span>)&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 2. 熱氣球籃筐 (<span style=\"color:#f60;font-size:14px\">任意木階</span>)&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/783283/description_0d2735ff-7993-4a3b-bc69-c5ed8472a814.png\" width=\"300\" height=\"170\"><img style=\"float:right\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/783283/description_399d8253-6f5f-4559-8dfc-4d9930baacd2.png\" width=\"300\" height=\"170\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>3. 熱氣球氣囊 (<span style=\"color:#f60;font-size:14px\">任意羊毛</span>)&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 4. 熱氣球</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img style=\"float:right\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/783283/description_6b37087a-8ce8-4d68-b18b-e8332581bdaf.png\" width=\"300\" height=\"170\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/783283/description_134de358-a6a2-4c9f-a212-b2a763993a04.png\" width=\"300\" height=\"170\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/783283/description_eddd6812-422e-4a17-91cd-82587d68b44e.png\"></p>\n<h2><strong>- 額外內容 -</strong></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">1. 要向你的熱氣球添加煤炭（或木炭），只需手持煤炭並<strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">右鍵點擊</span>.</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">2. 要拾取你的熱氣球，只需<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>蹲下右鍵點擊</strong></span>，它就會變回物品。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">3. 要延長飛行距離，請嘗試每隔幾秒鐘推進一次。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">4. 要讓熱氣球快速下降，請按<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>LCTRL</strong></span>（左控制鍵）</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><em><strong>- 分發條款 -</strong></em></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">*** <em>請勿複製、宣稱擁有或重新分發我的模組中的任何內容。***</em></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;- 你絕對可以製作<strong>影片、評論、教程、博客等。</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>&nbsp;- 並且</strong>非常歡迎你<strong>將它包含在你的模組包中！</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><em><strong>- 致謝 -</strong></em></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">所有內容和功能均由我，Conborg 創作。</span></p>\n<p><em><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">請在 <a href=\"https://patreon.com/ConborgsCreations?utm_medium=unknown&utm_source=join_link&utm_campaign=creatorshare_creator&utm_content=copyLink\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patreon!</a> 支持我（成為會員以獲取 Discord 伺服器訪問權限）</span></strong></em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>",
